{"speciesId":736,"names":{"fr":"Larvibule","es":"Grubbin","en":"Grubbin","ja":"アゴジムシ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il creuse l’écorce des arbres avec ses robustes mandibules pour en siroter la sève. Il vit en temps normal dans le sol."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Con sus duras mandíbulas arranca la corteza de los árboles y sorbe la savia. Suele habitar bajo tierra."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its strong jaw enables it to scrape trees and slurp out the sap. It normally lives underground."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"丈夫な 顎で 樹木を 削り 樹液を すする。 普段は 地面の 中で 暮らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Bien souvent, il se rend là où vivent les Pokémon Électrik, afin de se prémunir des attaques des Pokémon oiseaux."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Para evitar que los Pokémon pájaro los atormenten, suelen agruparse en lugares donde habitan Pokémon de tipo Eléctrico."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They often gather near places frequented by electric Pokémon in order to avoid being attacked by bird Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"とりポケモンに 襲われないよう でんきポケモンが 棲む 場所に 集まっていることが 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Larvibule n’aime pas les intrus, alors ne mettez pas la main dans son nid, sous peine de vous faire mordre !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Conviene no meter la mano en la madriguera de un Grubbin, so pena de provocarlo y llevarse un buen mordisco."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"If you find its nest, you shouldn’t stick your hand inside. You’ll get bitten by an irritated Grubbin."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"もし 巣穴を 見つけても 手を 突っ込んでは ダメだ。 嫌がる アゴジムシに 噛みつかれるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il crache un fil gluant pour empêtrer ses ennemis. Une fois immobilisés, il les attaque en les mordant de ses puissantes mandibules."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Inmoviliza al rival con el hilo viscoso que secreta y lo atrapa con sus duras y fuertes mandíbulas para atacarlo sin cuartel."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It spits a sticky thread to stop opponents in their tracks, and then it grabs them in its sharp, sturdy mandibles to take them down."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ネバネバした 糸を 吐き 相手の 動きを 止めた ところを 鋭く 丈夫なアゴで 挟み 仕留める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses mandibules peuvent briser de très grosses branches. Même Minisange, son ennemi naturel, s’enfuit à tire-d’aile devant lui."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Con sus potentes mandíbulas puede hacer trizas las ramas más gruesas y ahuyentar incluso a los Rookidee, su enemigo natural."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its natural enemies, like Rookidee, may flee rather than risk getting caught in its large mandibles that can snap thick tree branches."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"大きな 顎は 太い 枝を へし折る 威力。 天敵の ココガラも たまらず 逃げだす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il creuse son terrier dans le sol de la forêt avec ses grandes mandibules. Il raffole de la sève sucrée."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cava su madriguera en el lecho boscoso con sus grandes mandíbulas. Le encanta la savia dulce de los árboles."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It uses its big jaws to dig nests into the forest floor, and it loves to feed on sweet tree sap."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"大きな 顎で 森の 地面を 掘って 巣穴を つくる。 甘い 樹液が 大好物。"}],"varieties":[{"id":736,"moves":[{"name":"vice-grip","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"string-shot","learns":[[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",5],[25,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"